{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"title":[{"Plain":"ind-对象"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"ind-对象"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 的 ind-对象是其对象的形式"},{"Local":{"url":"滤余极限","text":"滤余极限"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>对偶的概念是 "},{"Local":{"url":"pro-对象","text":"pro-对象"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>通过可表函子的滤余极限</h3>\n<p>范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 的 ind-对象的范畴\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Ind}(\\mathcal C) \\hookrightarrow \\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathsf{Set})\r\n$$\n是"},{"Local":{"url":"可表函子","text":"可表函子"}},{"Plain":"在 $\\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathsf{Set})$ 中的"},{"Local":{"url":"滤余极限","text":"滤余极限"}},{"Plain":"构成的全子范畴.</p>\n<h3>通过平坦函子</h3>\n<p>范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 的 ind-对象的范畴也可定义为"},{"Local":{"url":"平坦函子","text":"平坦函子"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathsf{Ani}$ (或 $\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathsf{Set}$) 的范畴:\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Ind}(\\mathcal C) \\simeq \\mathsf{Flat}(\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathsf{Ani}).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"ind-概形","text":"ind-概形"}},{"Plain":"是一类常见的 ind-对象.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"ind-层","text":"ind-层"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}